following table reflects the contract balances as of the periods ended:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span><span id="xdx_8B4_zfwDRXIafgnf" style="display: none">SCHEDULE OF CONTRACT BALANCES</span></p>

