and includes $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--OtherInventoryInTransit_iI_pn5n6_c20230630_zKTqrqR6hAy2" title="In-transit inventory"><span id="xdx_907_eus-gaap--OtherInventoryInTransit_iI_pn5n6_c20221231_z7wFIMJj4gEf" title="In-transit inventory"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherInventoryInTransit" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherInventoryInTransit" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">0</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction></span></span> in-transit inventory at June 30, 2023 and December 31, 2022, respectively. The Company reviews inventory for obsolete
and slow-moving products each quarter and makes provisions based on its estimate of the probability that the material will not be consumed
or that it will be sold below cost. The inventory reserves were $<span id="xdx_90B_eus-gaap--InventoryValuationReserves_iI_pn5n6_c20230630_zAht3M4HuhRb" title="Inventory reserves"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InventoryValuationReserves" contextRef="AsOf2023-06-30" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.2</ix:nonFraction></span> million and $<span id="xdx_905_eus-gaap--InventoryValuationReserves_iI_pn5n6_c20221231_zIXDh0FQMLXg" title="Inventory reserves"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:InventoryValuationReserves" contextRef="AsOf2022-12-31" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="-5" scale="6" unitRef="USD">2.5</ix:nonFraction></span> million as of June 30, 2023 and December 31, 2022,
respectively.</span></p>

