components of lease costs were as follows:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in; margin-right: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span id="xdx_8BF_z8PyQgkWHmR5" style="display: none">SCHEDULE
OF COMPONENTS OF LEASE COSTS</span></span></p>

